--- transform -- list transform ops for the handl runtime.
---
--- Documentation surface for the `transform` interface: list-to-list and
--- fold operations (`map`, `filter`, `reduce`). The canonical pure-handl
--- implementations live alongside this file in `map.hnl`, `filter.hnl`,
--- and `reduce.hnl` (the per-arrow payload, re-exported as
--- `TRANSFORM_*_HNL` consts). The atom spec lives in `atoms.yaml`
--- (P-013/T-151) — name/sig/impl per op — and the native `Op` impls are
--- in `src/ops.rs`; the host's spec-driven `transform_impls()` table
--- (`plugin-lib-stdlib` `ops/kernel_impls.rs`) is what the `transform`
--- `ModuleSpec` consumes. `transform_op_registry()` stays for consumers
--- that still use it directly.
---
--- ## Capability declarations (ADR-0077 Phase 4)
--- transform.map -- map a function over a list.
--- transform.filter -- filter a list by a predicate.
--- transform.reduce -- fold a list with a function and an initial value.
